  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "- Complimentary, private GraytLife Rentals bonfire for you & your guests (staying in the home with you) for stays that are 5 nights or more<br><br>- Dog Friendly - Upon booking your stay, please let us know if you plan on bringing your dog.<br><br>After a $200 non-refundable pet fee is paid, we allow guests to bring 1 dog that is housebroken (potty trained) & under 20lbs. <br><br>- Private Pool – 12ft. x 14ft. (Not able to be heated)<br><br>- 5 minute walk to the beach <br><br>- 6 adult bikes (unisex beach cruisers)<br><br>- Large gas grill (propane tank available but will need to be filled)<br><br>- 7 dedicated parking spots<br><br>- ALL linens laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: <br>This home offers 5 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, a private pool, an outdoor shower, a short 5 minute walk to the beach, bike or golf cart ride to the beach and wonderful accommodations for up to 16 guests! <br><br>Its industrial interiors paired with high ceilings and refreshing décor set the stage for a relaxing and peaceful getaway. The second floor’s open-concept floorplan welcomes guests to relax and enjoy time together. The living room offers ample seating for your entire group along with a fully-stocked kitchen for all your cooking needs.<br><br>As you enter the home through the carport, there is one bedroom with 4 twin beds and a ½ bath. If you continue to walk through the hallway to the other door leading outside, you will find an outdoor shower within the fenced-in front yard. <br> <br>On the second floor, there is a Master King suite which includes a daybed with a trundle pull out for kids who need to be close to their parent(s) or just want to have a sleepover. Also, there is a full attached bath and a private deck that overlooks Defuniak Street. <br><br>Off the kitchen, on the other side of the second floor is a beautiful outdoor deck which is perfect for sipping coffee in the morning, enjoying a home-cooked dinner in the evenings, or watching the kids play in the fenced-in yard.<br><br>On the third floor, there is a queen master bedroom with a full bath attached along with two other queen bedrooms with a full bath in the hallway. This floor also has a full sized pull-out couch in the common area suitable for two guests to sleep on. <br><br>Guests in this home will love the sparkling private pool and spacious pool deck with lots of seating. There is also seating for 6 if you’d like to eat down by the pool or you can take a short stroll to enjoy delectable bites and delicious drinks at Chiringo or Red Bar—two of Grayton Beach’s best local spots. <br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br><br>All bedrooms equipped with blackout shades for a great night's sleep or an afternoon nap.<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br><br> - Twin bedroom: 4 twins with a ½ bath in the hallway <br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br><br>- Master Bedroom: 1 King bed, private full bath, LCD/HD flat screen TV<br> -Daybed w/ trundle pull out<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br><br>- Queen bedroom, private full bath attached, LCD/HD flat screen TV<br>- 2 Queen bedrooms each with LCD/HD flat screen TV<br>-1 full bath in the hallway<br>-1 pull out couch in common area with LCD/HD flat screen TV<br><br>No parties allowed at this home. Should there be damage from your stay, you will be subject to pay for all damaged items.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Dog Friendly +5 minute walk to PUBLIC BEACH & Red Bar +Private Pool +Bikes"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
